Glance TOS packaging
====================

This repository packages the official Glance dashboard for TerraMaster TOS 7
as an iframe Deb application. It is a packaging wrapper, not the upstream
Glance project itself, and it does not claim copyright in Glance.

Upstream project
----------------
- Name: Glance
- Repository: https://github.com/glanceapp/glance
- Version packaged: v0.8.8
- Official Linux binaries used unchanged:
  - https://github.com/glanceapp/glance/releases/download/v0.8.8/glance-linux-amd64.tar.gz
  - https://github.com/glanceapp/glance/releases/download/v0.8.8/glance-linux-arm64.tar.gz
- Corresponding source: https://github.com/glanceapp/glance/archive/refs/tags/v0.8.8.tar.gz
  and https://github.com/glanceapp/glance/tree/v0.8.8
- License: GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (see LICENSE)

This packaging (systemd units, Unix-socket proxy, maintainer scripts, default
configuration, and build scripts) is also released under the GNU Affero
General Public License v3.0. The complete corresponding source for the
packaging is this public repository.

